 rum sensing bacteria produce and release chemical signal molecules called
  autoinducers that increase in concentration as a function of cell densit
 y. The detection of a minimal threshold stimulatory concentration of an a
 utoinducer leads to an alteration in gene expression.”\n\nAlongside: Po
 nd brains and GPT-4 (Gordon Brander\, Squishy Computer\, 2023)\nhttps://n
 ewsletter.squishy.computer/p/pond-brains-and-gpt-4\n\nFeature: Guest: Dis
